# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://rangka-os.github.io/rangka-os/schema/0.5/module.json
# Consignment in (barang titipan): a shop sells goods a supplier still owns and pays for what sold, usually monthly.
# The goods come in through goods_receipt from the consignor (stock moves, no payable: payables come only from
# vendor_bill); item.consignor and item.consignment_cost (catalogue) mark them. Unsold goods go back through
# stock_adjustment with reason consignment_return. The monthly settlement becomes a draft vendor_bill (flow
# consignment_bill), so it is paid like any other bill.
name: consignment
version: 1.1.0
title: {id: Konsinyasi, en: Consignment}
summary:
  id: Catat barang titipan dan setoran hasil penjualannya.
  en: Track consigned goods and the money paid in for them.
category: sales
icon: hand-coin-line
requires: {rangka: '>=0.5', users: ^1.0, contacts: ^1.0, catalogue: ^1.0, outlets: ^1.0, stock: ^1.0, procurement: ^1.0}
